WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.244 --> 00:00:20.709
Zann writhed on the ground, his head exploding with sounds, feelings, and images.

2
00:00:21.609 --> 00:00:25.070
Once again fear, pain, and anger surged through him.

3
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.012
A faint voice called for help as waves splashed and rain pounded down.

4
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.821
Feeling seasick, Zann pressed both hands to his forehead.

5
00:00:35.641 --> 00:00:37.082
"Zann!" Perda cried.

6
00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:38.022
"What's wrong?"

7
00:00:39.302 --> 00:00:42.583
Zann squeezed his eyes shut, trying to block out her voice.

8
00:00:43.463 --> 00:00:48.105
The cry in his head was a little louder now, and it sounded vaguely familiar.

9
00:00:48.825 --> 00:00:49.505
Who could it be?

10
00:00:50.585 --> 00:00:52.866
Zann tried to focus as the cry came again.

11
00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.926
"Help me!"

12
00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:56.287
the person cried.

13
00:00:56.307 --> 00:01:00.408
"Please, someone help me before it's too late!"

14
00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:04.545
Then the feelings disappeared as abruptly as they had come.

15
00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:08.226
Zann sat up, sweating and breathing hard.

16
00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:11.467
"Zann!" Darb was squeezing his shoulder.

17
00:01:11.487 --> 00:01:12.587
"Are you all right?"

18
00:01:12.607 --> 00:01:15.868
"I—I think so."

19
00:01:16.889 --> 00:01:20.070
Zann gulped in a breath and slowly climbed to his feet.

20
00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.610
His whole body felt shaky.

21
00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:25.571
"I mean, yes, I'm okay.

22
00:01:26.631 --> 00:01:27.972
This has happened before."

23
00:01:29.196 --> 00:01:31.957
He described the mysterious Shares he'd been receiving.

24
00:01:32.877 --> 00:01:34.197
His friends looked confused.

25
00:01:34.217 --> 00:01:37.058
"Are they Red Shares or not?"

26
00:01:37.398 --> 00:01:38.058
Gliss asked.

27
00:01:39.179 --> 00:01:39.899
Zann shrugged.

28
00:01:39.919 --> 00:01:40.919
"I don't know.

29
00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.580
I can't tell who they're coming from."

30
00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.881
"Are you sure it's not Boz, or some other Red that you know?"

31
00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:48.761
Darb asked.

32
00:01:49.762 --> 00:01:50.642
Zann shook his head.

33
00:01:50.662 --> 00:01:52.182
"I checked last time.

34
00:01:53.103 --> 00:01:57.984
Boz and the others contacted every Red they could think of, and nobody knew anything about the Shares."

35
00:01:59.476 --> 00:02:00.437
"That's weird."

36
00:02:00.797 --> 00:02:03.539
Perda chewed her lower lip, looking thoughtful.

37
00:02:03.559 --> 00:02:07.602
"I've never read anything about this kind of magic."

38
00:02:07.622 --> 00:02:13.086
"My mom and dad think it could be a result of having all those relics close by," Zann

39
00:02:13.126 --> 00:02:19.611
said. "They said the relics possess such strong and ancient magic that they might be affecting our regular

40
00:02:19.651 --> 00:02:27.892
magic." "Speaking of the relics, I hope it's not Morb contacting you," Perda said half-jokingly.

41
00:02:27.912 --> 00:02:30.133
"Maybe he's up to more magical tricks."

42
00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:32.373
Gliss frowned at her.

43
00:02:32.393 --> 00:02:33.954
"It couldn't be Morb.

44
00:02:34.994 --> 00:02:37.935
Wyssa made sure that he will never do magic again."

45
00:02:37.955 --> 00:02:41.556
"Or anything else," Zann put in with a shudder.

46
00:02:41.576 --> 00:02:44.677
"I was only joking," Perda told them.

47
00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:47.898
"Do you think it's—" A shout interrupted her.

48
00:02:48.878 --> 00:02:50.478
Two women were hurrying toward them.

49
00:02:50.698 --> 00:02:52.039
They both looked excited.

50
00:02:52.059 --> 00:02:54.660
"It's you, isn't it?"

51
00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:55.860
one woman exclaimed.

52
00:02:57.036 --> 00:02:57.956
"The hero kids?"

53
00:02:59.197 --> 00:03:00.697
The second woman pointed at Zing.

54
00:03:00.717 --> 00:03:03.958
"I even recognize the dragon!"

55
00:03:04.238 --> 00:03:04.698
she cried.

56
00:03:04.718 --> 00:03:06.639
"But I forgot his name!"

57
00:03:07.619 --> 00:03:11.540
For the next few minutes, Zann and his friends had to answer the women's questions.

58
00:03:12.481 --> 00:03:15.041
Finally Zann made an excuse to hurry away.

59
00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:19.303
"Maybe we should take a shortcut to Saffa's house," Zann said.

60
00:03:19.323 --> 00:03:21.343
"Let's go through the park."

61
00:03:22.384 --> 00:03:22.984
He led the way.

62
00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.853
Halfway across the park, he heard voices ahead.

63
00:03:28.873 --> 00:03:31.974
"Uh-oh," Gliss said with a smile.

64
00:03:31.994 --> 00:03:35.955
"Do you think more of our fans are looking for us?"

65
00:03:37.115 --> 00:03:40.656
Just then a group of people marched into view, waving signs.

66
00:03:41.717 --> 00:03:42.937
Perda's eyes widened.

67
00:03:42.957 --> 00:03:47.698
"Is it one of those Void rights protests we keep hearing about?"

68
00:03:47.898 --> 00:03:48.979
she whispered to Zann.

69
00:03:49.899 --> 00:03:50.539
Zann nodded.

70
00:03:50.559 --> 00:03:53.200
"There are even more protests now," he said.

71
00:03:54.432 --> 00:03:56.393
"A guy named Laddno took over the movement."

72
00:03:57.234 --> 00:03:59.335
"Oh, I've heard about him," Gliss said.

73
00:03:59.355 --> 00:04:05.158
"My parents were talking about how hard he's working to bring attention to the Void rights cause."

74
00:04:06.158 --> 00:04:08.860
Zann glanced at Darb, who was staring at the ground.

75
00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.242
Before Zann could say anything, Perda nudged him.

76
00:04:12.262 --> 00:04:14.523
"Look!" she exclaimed.

77
00:04:14.543 --> 00:04:16.184
"Is that Jev?

78
00:04:17.004 --> 00:04:18.865
What's he doing in First City?"

79
00:04:20.046 --> 00:04:21.066
Zann sighed.

80
00:04:21.086 --> 00:04:23.568
"He's here for the protests."

81
00:04:24.748 --> 00:04:27.470
Jev was marching with the others, waving a colorful sign.

82
00:04:28.651 --> 00:04:30.692
He spotted Zann and his friends and came over.

83
00:04:31.753 --> 00:04:35.135
Zann expected him to say hi to Gliss, but Jev ignored her.

84
00:04:36.136 --> 00:04:39.758
He ignored Zann too and only gave Perda a halfhearted smile.

85
00:04:40.819 --> 00:04:43.921
Instead Jev's eyes were focused on Darb.

86
00:04:43.941 --> 00:04:47.223
"Hey, Darb," he said in a friendly voice.

87
00:04:47.243 --> 00:04:50.345
"I didn't expect to see you in First City."

88
00:04:51.226 --> 00:04:52.447
Darb looked surprised.

89
00:04:53.067 --> 00:04:54.268
Zann knew how he felt.

90
00:04:55.104 --> 00:04:58.385
Jev had always been mean to Darb and the other Voids in Swamp Bottom.

91
00:04:59.225 --> 00:05:02.206
In fact, that was how Zann and Darb had become friends.

92
00:05:03.246 --> 00:05:08.188
Soon after moving to Swamp Bottom, Zann had stood up to Jev when Jev was bullying Darb.

93
00:05:09.848 --> 00:05:11.508
Jev shot the others a dirty look.

94
00:05:12.609 --> 00:05:15.670
"You shouldn't be hanging around with Reds," he told Darb.

95
00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.750
"Why don't you come with me?

96
00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:23.932
I can introduce you to some people who are working to get equal magic for all—even Voids like

97
00:05:24.012 --> 00:05:26.973
you." "No thanks," Darb said.

98
00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:29.235
"I'd rather stay with my friends."

99
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:31.377
Jev frowned.

100
00:05:31.397 --> 00:05:33.399
"Suit yourself," he said.

101
00:05:33.419 --> 00:05:38.143
"But Laddno wants everyone to join in the struggle for equality."

102
00:05:39.084 --> 00:05:41.046
Suddenly cheers came from the group.

103
00:05:42.066 --> 00:05:44.569
Most of the protestors were yelling Laddno's name.

104
00:05:45.629 --> 00:05:46.470
Jev brightened.

105
00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.491
"He's here!"

106
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:48.192
he cried.

107
00:05:48.212 --> 00:05:50.474
"I heard he might come today."

108
00:05:51.374 --> 00:05:53.272
He smirked at Zann and Gliss.

109
00:05:53.292 --> 00:05:55.434
"You might want to hide your hair, you two."

110
00:05:56.395 --> 00:05:58.697
Jev dashed away before anyone could respond.

111
00:05:59.798 --> 00:06:00.859
Gliss looked uneasy.

112
00:06:00.879 --> 00:06:03.061
"Let's get out of here," she said.

113
00:06:03.081 --> 00:06:05.243
"Hold on for a second."

114
00:06:05.524 --> 00:06:08.446
Perda stepped forward and peered over the heads of the crowd.

115
00:06:08.466 --> 00:06:11.469
"I want to get a look at Laddno."

116
00:06:11.489 --> 00:06:14.012
"Me too," Zann said.

117
00:06:17.664 --> 00:06:22.407
He and his friends stood on their tiptoes as a man strode onto a dais that someone had

118
00:06:22.467 --> 00:06:23.187
just conjured.

119
00:06:24.228 --> 00:06:26.849
Zann recognized Laddno right away from the ads.

120
00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.651
He had a large, square head and broad shoulders.

121
00:06:31.672 --> 00:06:34.333
His deep-set eyes swept over the crowd.

122
00:06:34.353 --> 00:06:38.095
"Greetings, citizens of First City!"

123
00:06:38.516 --> 00:06:40.337
Laddno shouted, raising both hands.

124
00:06:40.357 --> 00:06:42.598
"Thank you for coming today."

125
00:06:42.618 --> 00:06:44.659
"Void rights!"

126
00:06:45.059 --> 00:06:46.180
someone in the crowd shouted.

127
00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:48.669
"Banish the greedy Reds!"

128
00:06:49.009 --> 00:06:49.950
someone else shrieked.

129
00:06:50.971 --> 00:06:52.952
The rest of the onlookers cheered loudly.

130
00:06:54.053 --> 00:06:54.793
Gliss shivered.

131
00:06:54.813 --> 00:06:56.795
"Come on, you guys," she said.

132
00:06:56.815 --> 00:06:58.976
"We shouldn't be here."

133
00:07:00.077 --> 00:07:01.218
This time Zann agreed.

134
00:07:01.238 --> 00:07:02.218
"Let's go."

135
00:07:03.379 --> 00:07:06.241
He grabbed Darb and Perda, and Perda grabbed Gliss.

136
00:07:06.261 --> 00:07:10.424
"Zap!" Zann whispered, aiming for Saffa's house.
